    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE DEMO AVAILABLE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Arrows is a 2D puzzle game, where the rules are everchanging but only controls you'll have are the movement keys. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll explore grid-based maps, encountering both self-contained logic puzzles and exploration based treasure hunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test things out, learn and study the environment to get the keys required to advance further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full release features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels, each with its own theme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level comprised of several logic puzzles and movement challenges, each unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trophies for completing everything in a level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only movement keys to control everything in the game</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE DEMO AVAILABLE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Arrows is a 2D puzzle game, where the rules are everchanging but only controls you'll have are the movement keys. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll explore grid-based maps, encountering both self-contained logic puzzles and exploration based treasure hunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test things out, learn and study the environment to get the keys required to advance further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full release features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels, each with its own theme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level comprised of several logic puzzles and movement challenges, each unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trophies for completing everything in a level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only movement keys to control everything in the game</p></li></ul>",
